# Generated inside a vault built from this kit — never commit. Anchored to the vault root (leading
# "/") so these names don't also match same-named system/fixture files nested under .tools/** (e.g.
# the AGENTS.md template at .tools/kit/AGENTS.md, which MUST stay tracked — it's the source skills-build.mjs
# renders from on every session; an unanchored "AGENTS.md" pattern would silently untrack it).
/INDEX.md
/graph.json
wiki/_index.md
wiki/*/**/_*.md
/AGENTS.md
.logs/
.qmd*
/.agents/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
